                                    <div class="bg-[#0D0F15] border border-[#222634] p-4 rounded-lg space-y-2 text-xs font-mono">
                                        <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-[#222634]/60">
                                            <span class="text-[#64748B]">Nomor Pesanan:</span>
